  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.2 - Unified cron validation, retry enhancements and code review fixes\n      - FIX: Unified cron expression validation entry point - all paths now use CronValidator.IsValidExpression()\n      - FIX: ReflectionJob.ScheduleRetryAsync logger retrieval replaced fragile reflection with a proper ILogger parameter\n      - FIX: isRetry flag declared before use, added [RETRY] log marker and Retry={IsRetry} in execution logs for better traceability\n      - FIX: Added XML doc clarifying LockTimeoutSeconds dual-mode semantics (Redis lock TTL vs hard execution timeout)\n      - IMPROVE: Added retry-related unit tests validating retry parameter serialization and default values\n      - IMPROVE: Added RetryWithCounter helper for repeatable retry end-to-end verification\n      - IMPROVE: Full code review across all business paths (Dashboard/Models/Jobs/Infrastructure/Data/Services)\n\n      v1.0.1 - Bug fixes and improvements\n      - FIX: HttpJob Redis dependency made optional (supports single-instance deployment without Redis)\n      - FIX: QuartzStartupHostedService startup lock Redis dependency made optional\n      - FIX: ContinuationEngine empty catch block now logs deserialization errors\n      - FIX: ReflectionJob uses CancellationToken.None when updating records after timeout (prevents silent record loss)\n      - FIX: Test project strong naming with InternalsVisibleTo\n      - FIX: NSubstitute mock parameter matching for RedisLock tests\n      - IMPROVE: Comprehensive test coverage for core components (ChainEdgeStore, EvaluateRule, ConvertArgument, etc.)\n      - IMPROVE: Detailed documentation (data-execution-path.md and data-execution-path-detailed.md)\n      - IMPROVE: Full code review and bug fixes across the entire class library\n\n      v1.0.0 - Initial release\n      - Cron-based scheduling with standard cron expressions\n      - DAG task chains (parent-child relationships with OnSuccess/OnFailure/Always rules)\n      - Redis distributed locks with watchdog auto-renewal\n      - Hangfire-style Enqueue and RecurringJob API\n      - Multi-database support (SQL Server / MySQL / PostgreSQL / SQLite)\n      - Embedded dashboard for task management\n      - RESTful API for CRUD + Pause/Resume/Trigger/Replay\n      - Snowflake ID generation\n      - Auto table creation on startup",
